OL,3,GNEWSABakery secures 2028 Borough Market
OL,4,Alease extension
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular bakery has secured an
OL,7,Fextension allowing it to continue
OL,8,Frunning its baking school at Borough
OL,9,FMarket until at least March 2028, but
OL,10,Fits founder says the business will
OL,11,Feventually have to leave the site.
OL,13,FBread Ahead owner Matthew Jones said
OL,14,Fthe agreement had eased uncertainty
OL,15,Fover the future of the business, which
OL,16,Fstarted at the market in Southwark,
OL,17,Fsouth London, in 2013.
OL,19,FJones told the BBC the past few weeks
OL,20,Fhad been "pretty stressful" because of
OL,21,Fthe uncertainty surrounding the
OL,22,Ftenancy.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
