OL,3,GNEWSABakery secures 2028 Borough Market
OL,4,Alease extension
OL,5,
OL,6,FShane Holland, chairman of the Borough
OL,7,FMarket Trust, said the extension had
OL,8,Ffirst been discussed in July and had
OL,9,Fremained on the table throughout recent
OL,10,Fnegotiations.
